* Frequency response of device models: a junction's capacitance under reverse bias,
* a transistor's junction capacitances and transit time, a JFET at a small overdrive.
* tests/models.mjs runs "bench" here and in ngspice; tests/spicenet.test.mjs keeps ngspice's numbers.
.model DV D(IS=1e-14 CJO=100p VJ=0.7 M=0.45 RS=1)
.model QT NPN(IS=1e-14 BF=200 VAF=80 CJE=12p VJE=0.7 MJE=0.35 CJC=6p VJC=0.6 MJC=0.4 TF=0.4n RB=50)
.model QP PNP(IS=2e-14 BF=150 VAF=60 CJE=15p CJC=9p TF=0.6n RB=40)
.model JN NJF(VTO=-2 BETA=1.2m LAMBDA=0.01 CGS=4p CGD=3p PB=0.8 IS=1e-14)
.subckt bench in dv qc pc jn
Vcc vcc 0 30
Vin in 0 DC 0 AC 1
* a diode 30 V in reverse behind 100 k
Rd1 vcc dv 100k
Cd in dvx 1u
Rd2 dvx dv 100k
D1 0 dv DV
* a common-emitter stage
Cq in qx 1u
Rq1 vcc qb 470k
Rq2 qb 0 68k
Rqs qx qb 4.7k
Rqc vcc qc 4.7k
Rqe qe 0 1k
Cqe qe 0 100u
Q1 qc qb qe QT
* the same with a PNP
Cp in px 1u
Rp1 pb 0 470k
Rp2 vcc pb 68k
Rps px pb 4.7k
Rpc pc 0 4.7k
Rpe vcc pe 1k
Cpe vcc pe 100u
Q2 pc pb pe QP
* a JFET close to pinch-off
Cj in jx 1u
Rjg jg 0 1Meg
Rjs jx jg 47k
Rjd vcc jn 22k
Rjx js 0 3.3k
Cjx js 0 100u
J1 jn jg js JN
.ends
